# --- Analysis outputs ---
# results/biomarkers/ and results/inference_bwh_backup/ ARE tracked: they are
# the cached NUTS posteriors and the derived tables the manuscript quotes, and
# the reproduction pipeline reads them. Everything else under results/ is
# scratch from exploratory runs.
results/*
!results/biomarkers/
!results/inference_bwh_backup/

# Conference-poster outputs (regenerable; not part of the manuscript)
results/biomarkers/ismrm/

# Patient image crops (not referenced by the release; kept locally only)
assets/*.jpeg

